  "description": "Base / Home Port: Lake Kariba, Zimbabwe\nOperating Area: Africa\n\nEmbark on a once-in-a-lifetime journey aboard the only yacht in the world where you can share the waters with wild animals like elephants, rhinos, and hippos. On Yachts MATUSADONA, you’ll cruise across Africa’s wildest and most iconic lake, surrounded by nature at its most raw and beautiful. Our 3-deck vessel is designed to offer exceptional comfort, blending the familiar warmth of home with the timeless elegance of \"Out of Africa.\" Every detail on board has been crafted to ensure your experience is nothing short of extraordinary.",
